ENTRY            10112   20000202   20000306   20050926       0000
SUBENT        10112001   20000202   20000306   20050926       0000
BIB                 13         28
INSTITUTE  (1USAORL)
REFERENCE  (R,ORNL-4549,197006)
AUTHOR     (W.E.KINNEY,F.G.PEREY)
TITLE      Neutron elastic- and inelastic-scattering cross
            sections for Co in the energy range 4.19 to 8.56 MeV
FACILITY   (VDG,1USAORL) ORNL Van de Graaff, pulsed at 2 mhz and
            bunched.
INC-SOURCE (D-D) D(d,n) reaction using gas cells ranging in length
            from 0.7 to 4.0 cm. Neutron energy resolution between
            50 to 170 keV.
SAMPLE     Solid right circular cylinder 1.89 cm diameter,
            2.54 cm high placed 10 to 30 cm from gas cell.
METHOD     (TOF) Time-of-flight. 2.5 nanosec resolution (FWHM).
DETECTOR   (SCIN)  12.5 cm diameter NE213 liquid scintillator
            viewed by XP-1040 photomultipliers.  Flight paths of
            4 to 6 meters employed.
MONITOR    (1-H-1(N,EL)1-H-1,,DA) Detector efficiency determined
            relative to n-p cross section.
CORRECTION  Corrected for multiple scattering and other finite
            sample size effects.
STATUS     (APRVD) Approved by authors.
           Data rec'd in private comm., Kinney, July 1971.
HISTORY    (19720712R)
           (19750421A) ISO-QUANT corrected on subentries 46-50,52.
           (19820524A) Converted to REACTION formalism
           (19840416A) BIB corrections.
           (20000202A) Converted to new date format, lower case.
                       BIB corrections.
ENDBIB              28
NOCOMMON             0          0
ENDSUBENT           31
ENDENTRY             1
